  "Research outlines are approximate areas of association. Photo pins can identify a depicted building or a street attribution rather than an exact historical camera. Building heights, footprint registration and unseen forms remain approximate. These views are reconstructed historical studies, not historical satellite imagery.": "街区界限是近似的研究范围。照片标记可能指向画面中的建筑或所属街道，未必是实际拍摄点。建筑高度、轮廓定位和不可见形态仍是近似值。这些视图是历史重建研究，并非历史卫星影像。",
  "A street camera is placed near the closest mapped street segment to avoid entering a building. Its position is a navigational choice, not an archival camera reconstruction. New approved photographs and notes continue to enter the archive. Building events retain their own dates, sources and geometry associations.": "街道视角设置在附近已绘制的道路上，避免镜头落入建筑内部。它是浏览位置，不代表历史照片的真实机位。经审核的新照片和笔记可继续进入史料库；建筑事件分别保留年代、来源和几何关联。",
