  "The saved source needs a map location before it can be restored here.": "这份已保存研究的原始史料需要先关联地图位置。",
  "Choose a location first": "请先选择位置",
  "Drag to select a building in the photograph": "拖动框选照片中的建筑",
  "Speculative reconstruction generated from a confirmed camera view, archival evidence and user directions": "依据确认机位、档案证据与创作提示生成的推演性重建",
  "Confirmed 3D viewpoint supplied to image generation": "提供给图像生成的已确认三维视角",
  "DHS accession 2012.022.580. Pre-relocation streetscape; catalog names Shanghai Chop Suey. Does not establish a Chinatown enclave here in 1927.": "底特律历史学会藏品 2012.022.580。迁址前的街景；图录提及 Shanghai Chop Suey 餐馆。这并不能证明 1927 年此处已形成唐人街。",
  "Archive date; temporary convention decorations.": "日期来自档案目录；照片中的装饰为临时的会议装饰。",
  "Reuther catalog date. Do not merge this with the May 12 opening date reported by the city.": "日期来自 Reuther 图录，不应与底特律市记录的 5 月 12 日开幕日期混为一谈。",
  "Continue into the archive": "继续查阅史料库",
  "Main navigation": "主导航",
  "Coleman Young and Chinese Merchants Association representatives": "Coleman Young 与中华商会代表",
  "People photographed outside; DPL credit supplied by City. Exact day and frontage require confirmation.": "户外合影；底特律市标注来源为底特律公共图书馆。具体日期与建筑正面位置仍待核实。",
  "People seated along a storefront under an awning": "坐在沿街店面遮阳篷下的人们",
  "Visible storefront, awning, benches and seated people; Reuther attribution through City. Names, address and exposure date unverified.": "可见店面、遮阳篷、长椅与坐着的人。底特律市标注来源为 Reuther 图书馆；人物姓名、地址与拍摄日期尚未核实。",
  "Close view of the restaurant sign, not a complete building facade. City links Wayne State vmc79118_1; 3148 Second is the restaurant association from City text.": "餐馆招牌的近景，不是完整的建筑立面。底特律市链接至 Wayne State 藏品 vmc79118_1；Second 大道 3148 号的餐馆地址来自市政府文字记录。",
  "Restaurant kitchen: cooks at a wok range": "餐馆厨房：灶台前的厨师",
  "Visible cooks, wok range, metal lids and preparation surfaces. Reuther attribution through City. Restaurant name and exposure date not confirmed.": "可见厨师、炒锅灶台、金属锅盖与备餐台。底特律市标注来源为 Reuther 图书馆；餐馆名称与拍摄日期尚未确认。",
  "Yee family / restaurant photograph": "Yee 家族与餐馆照片",
  "City / Historypin identify Forbidden City; Reuther node 9918 describes an unidentified restaurant. Preserve this attribution difference.": "底特律市与 Historypin 将其标为 Forbidden City 餐馆；Reuther 的 9918 号记录则称餐馆名称不详。两种归属说法须分别保留。",
  "Detroit Free Press Chinatown article": "《Detroit Free Press》的唐人街报道",
  "Publication date; p.30. News clipping reproduced by City; addresses should be cross-checked.": "日期为出版日期，见第 30 页。剪报由底特律市转载；其中地址仍需交叉核实。",
  "Handwritten print caption identifies Clarence M. Burton International Elementary School and 1983. School architecture baseline; Chinese-school use needs independent source attribution.": "照片手写说明注明 Clarence M. Burton 国际小学与 1983 年。可作学校建筑的参考；华文学校的使用情况需要单独的来源依据。",
  "Handwritten caption describes playground viewed from a second-floor classroom. Supports spatial relation between classroom, playground and street.": "手写说明称画面是从二层教室看到的操场，可用于研究教室、操场与街道之间的空间关系。",
  "Handwritten caption identifies the lunch room and 1983. Do not infer the children’s identities or ethnicities.": "手写说明注明食堂与 1983 年。不能据此推断儿童的身份或族裔。",
  "Children and classroom windows visible. Original print date not confidently legible in the available reproduction.": "可见儿童与教室窗户。现有复制图中，原照片的日期无法可靠辨认。",
  "(7821) Ethnic Communities, Chinese, Celebrations, Chinatown, Detroit, 1943": "（7821）底特律唐人街华人庆典，1943 年",
  "(38883) Ethnic Communities, Chinese, Demonstrations, 1938": "（38883）华人示威活动，1938 年",
  "Anti-occupation demonstration; catalog explicitly qualifies street location.": "反对侵占的示威；图录对街道位置使用了带保留的表述。",
  "(79693) Ethnic Communities, Chinese, Language, 1958": "（79693）华人语言记录，1958 年",
  "Lee Shing, groceryman, demonstrates written Chinese. Address is explicitly cataloged.": "杂货商 Lee Shing 展示中文书写；图录明确记录了地址。",
  "(79702) Ethnic Communities, Chinese, War Refugees, 1938": "（79702）华人与战争难民救助，1938 年",
  "Chan Tong collects clothing for war refugees; 1341 Third is the distribution point, NOT the photographed laundry.": "Chan Tong 为战争难民收集衣物。第三街 1341 号是分发地点，不是照片中洗衣店的位置。",
  "(79715) Ethnic Communities, Chinese, Gambling, Chinatown, Detroit, 1953": "（79715）唐人街赌博事件相关照片，1953 年",
  "Photographed at police headquarters after a raid; do not map this photograph to the raid’s Third Street location.": "照片在突袭行动后的警察总部拍摄，不能将照片定位到第三街的突袭地点。",
  "(79717) Ethnic Communities, Chinese, Chinatown, Detroit, 1980": "（79717）底特律唐人街，1980 年",
  "Blossom Gam Cohoe and Mable Lim examine a display of early settlers.": "Blossom Gam Cohoe 与 Mable Lim 查看有关早期移民的展示。",
  "(79727) Ethnic Communities, Chinese, War Relief, 1938": "（79727）华人战争救济活动，1938 年",
  "Lee Din donates to refugee relief. Arrival in 1888 is biographical history, not the photograph date.": "Lee Din 为难民救济捐款。1888 年抵达的时间属于个人经历，不是照片拍摄日期。",
  "(79743) Ethnic Communities, Chinese, Celebrations, 1942": "（79743）华人庆典，1942 年",
  "(79745) Ethnic Communities, Chinese, Celebrations, 1955": "（79745）华人庆典，1955 年",
  "Dragon and firecrackers at a celebration.": "庆典中的舞龙与鞭炮。",
  "Film, Motion Picture - China Town Work Printouts Citi Outs #2 | Detroit Historical Society": "影片：China Town Work Printouts Citi Outs #2",
  "Film 2015.011.011: rooftops near Howard / Second, cooking, store, clothing, Chinese classroom, tea, planning map and museum. Scene index is based on the catalog, not a timecoded transcript.": "影片 2015.011.011 包含 Howard / Second 附近屋顶、烹饪、商店、服饰、华文教室、饮茶、规划图与博物馆。场景索引依据图录整理，尚非带时间码的逐字稿。",
  "Film, Motion Picture - George Stark - Negative China Town - Negative Gates Benyee - Negative FBI Raid Pic - Negative Chinese School Project - Negative W.P. Prx, SS Neg, OK Sound Gracil, Snufry McGill | Detroit Historical Society": "影片：George Stark、唐人街、华文学校等片段",
  "Film 2015.011.010: teacher interview, George Stark footage and police photograph. Teacher says school opened in 1953; do not silently merge with an earlier school photograph.": "影片 2015.011.010 包含教师访谈、George Stark 影像与警方照片。教师称学校于 1953 年开办；不应在没有解释的情况下与更早的学校照片合并。",
  "Remembering Detroit’s Chinatown history, from the Shanghai Cafe to the Chinese Merchants Association · Outlier Media": "Sandra Lee 回忆底特律唐人街：从上海餐馆到中华商会",
  "Sandra Lee recounts family restaurant, bereavement, ownership and association support. Recollection dates and building chronology need separate attribution.": "Sandra Lee 回忆家庭餐馆、亲人离世、产权与商会支持。回忆所述年代与建筑年代需要分别注明依据。",
  "Detroit’s Chinatown Has Vanished, But This Queer Writer Keeps the Memories Alive in New Memoir": "Curtis Chin 以回忆录延续底特律唐人街记忆",
  "Author interview around a memoir of family restaurant life and growing up queer. Use attributed recollections; the published memoir is not downloaded.": "围绕家庭餐馆生活与酷儿成长经历的作者访谈。使用时须注明回忆者；本资料库未下载已出版的回忆录全文。",
  "Detroit's Chinatown takes step toward revival with streetscape project designs": "底特律唐人街街景设计与复兴计划",
  "Lisa Yee-Litzenberg recalls father Henry Yee and restaurant work in an interview about the proposed streetscape. Publication date is not memory date.": "Lisa Yee-Litzenberg 在关于拟议街景改造的访谈中，回忆父亲 Henry Yee 与餐馆工作。报道发布日期不等于回忆中事件的日期。",
  "Destination Detroit | Chinatown / Sandy Fatt | Destination Detroit Shorts | PBS": "Destination Detroit：唐人街 / Sandy Fatt 访谈",
  "Sandy Fatt interview: church, migration, suburbanization and demolition. Public transcript available; demographic figures are speaker claims, not independently verified census values.": "Sandy Fatt 谈及教会、迁移、郊区化与拆除。有公开文字稿；人口数字为受访者的陈述，尚未与人口普查独立核实。",
  "Walter P. Reuther Library": "Reuther 图书馆的唐人街历史导览",
  "Reuther’s own tour links archive photographs and community history. Earliest collection date does not mean a 1917 image was downloaded in this batch.": "Reuther 的导览关联档案照片与社区历史。馆藏最早日期不代表本批资料已下载 1917 年照片。",
  "Detroit's Chinatowns | Detroit Historical Society": "底特律的两个唐人街｜底特律历史学会",
  "Museum overview supplies family photographs and identifies church, school, opera and Belle Isle picnics as research themes.": "博物馆概述提供家庭照片，并将教会、学校、戏曲与 Belle Isle 野餐列为研究线索。",
  "Sanborn map · Volume 1, sheet 15": "Sanborn 地图：第 1 卷，第 15 图幅",
  "An earlier parcel baseline, not evidence of unchanged buildings in 1950.": "较早的地块参考，不能证明建筑在 1950 年仍保持原貌。",
  "Locating Detroit’s original Chinatown": "定位底特律原唐人街",
  "Secondary map overlay; approximate location, not a surveyed parcel.": "二次研究的地图叠合；位置为近似值，不是实测地块。",
  "Cass Corridor’s Chinatown": "Cass Corridor 的唐人街",
  "Historical synthesis; preserves an unresolved Cass Avenue address discrepancy.": "历史综合叙述，保留 Cass 大道地址尚未解决的分歧。",
  "The New Chinatown · newspaper page": "新唐人街：报纸版面",
  "A newspaper page republished by the city StoryMap; lists 3153 Cass, conflicting with the city’s 3143 Cass address.": "由市政府 StoryMap 转载的报纸页面列出 Cass 大道 3153 号，与市政府记录的 3143 号不一致。",
  "1921 Sanborn: Cass / Peterboro, Volume 2, Sheet 70": "1921 年 Sanborn：Cass / Peterboro，第 2 卷，第 70 图幅",
  "Fire-insurance map. Sheet 70 supplies the manually simplified footprint envelopes west of Cass, between Second, Stimson and Charlotte. Approximate registration is a contemporary research derivative, not a surveyed historical coordinate system. The map predates the 1963 Chinatown relocation.": "火险地图。第 70 图幅提供 Cass 西侧、Second、Stimson 与 Charlotte 之间街区的人工简化建筑轮廓。近似配准是当代研究成果，不是经过测量的历史坐标系统。该地图早于 1963 年唐人街迁址。",
  "1921 Sanborn: Cass / Peterboro, Volume 2, Sheet 72": "1921 年 Sanborn：Cass / Peterboro，第 2 卷，第 72 图幅",
  "Fire-insurance map of the blocks east of Cass near Peterboro and Charlotte. Retained as an additional spatial source; this sheet has not yet been traced into the 3D baseline.": "Peterboro 与 Charlotte 附近、Cass 东侧街区的火险地图。作为额外空间来源保留；尚未从此图幅提取三维基础轮廓。",
  "Catalog describes a view south along Third from Michigan Avenue. Restaurant signs and the street sequence offer spatial context; the exact camera coordinate has not been surveyed.": "图录描述从 Michigan 大道沿第三街向南的视野。餐馆招牌与沿街序列提供空间背景；具体拍摄坐标尚未经测量确定。",
  "Pre-demolition storefront view. Visible restaurant signage and adjacent fronts support study of street relationships; dimensions and unseen building depth remain unresolved.": "拆除前的沿街店面。可见的餐馆招牌与相邻立面支持街道关系研究；尺寸与不可见的建筑进深仍待确认。",
  "The Detroit Public Library catalogs this as Third Street. The 1963 issue date must not move it to the relocated Cass area. The storefront photograph records entrances, display windows and goods.": "底特律公共图书馆将地点标为第三街，不能因 1963 年发行日期而将其移到迁址后的 Cass 地区。照片记录店铺入口、橱窗与货品。",
  "Cass Corridor’s Chinatown · building histories and chronology": "Cass Corridor 唐人街：建筑历史与时间线",
  "City Historic Designation Advisory Board account: 3143 Cass began as a house in the 1880s; plans to remodel around 1921; On Leong ownership 1963–1980; demolished July 29, 2023. Chung’s closure in 2000 is a business event, not a demolition date.": "底特律市历史指定顾问委员会记述：Cass 大道 3143 号始建于 1880 年代，约 1921 年有改造计划；1963–1980 年归安良商会所有；2023 年 7 月 29 日拆除。Chung’s 于 2000 年停业属于经营事件，不是拆除日期。",
  "Detroit Chinatown Vision Committee · 3143 Cass demolition": "底特律唐人街愿景委员会：Cass 大道 3143 号拆除",
  "The community committee identifies the July 29, 2023 demolition of the former Chinese Merchants Association building as a catalyst for its formation.": "社区委员会将原中华商会建筑于 2023 年 7 月 29 日被拆除，视为促成委员会成立的事件。",
  "Detroit Chinese — Cover: Detroit Chinese": "《Detroit Chinese》选页：封面",
  "One of ten photographed selections, not the complete pamphlet. National Chinese Welfare Council of Detroit funding credited on cover; Burton Historical Collection, DPL. Exact publication and individual photograph dates not established.": "这十份拍摄选页中的一页，不是完整宣传册。封面注明由底特律 National Chinese Welfare Council 资助；藏于底特律公共图书馆 Burton 历史馆藏。确切出版日期与各张照片的拍摄日期尚未确定。",
  "Detroit Chinese — Chinatown: lively and growing": "《Detroit Chinese》选页：蓬勃发展的唐人街",
  "Detroit Chinese — Chinatown: business and social": "《Detroit Chinese》选页：商业与社交",
  "Detroit Chinese — On Leong birthday party": "《Detroit Chinese》选页：安良商会生日聚会",
  "Detroit Chinese — Youth clubs and contributions": "《Detroit Chinese》选页：青年社团与贡献",
  "Detroit Chinese — Detroit Chinese School (printed p.12)": "《Detroit Chinese》选页：底特律华文学校（印刷页码 12）",
  "One of ten photographed selections, not the complete pamphlet. National Chinese Welfare Council of Detroit funding credited on cover; Burton Historical Collection, DPL. Exact publication and individual photograph dates not established. Exterior inscription identifies Clarence M. Burton School; students, classroom and calligraphy pictured.": "这十份拍摄选页中的一页，不是完整宣传册。封面注明由底特律 National Chinese Welfare Council 资助；藏于底特律公共图书馆 Burton 历史馆藏。确切出版日期与各张照片的拍摄日期尚未确定。建筑外部铭文注明 Clarence M. Burton School；页面可见学生、教室与书法。",
  "Detroit Chinese — Cultural symposium and Chinese arts": "《Detroit Chinese》选页：文化研讨与中华艺术",
  "Detroit Chinese — ACA clinic and senior services": "《Detroit Chinese》选页：ACA 诊所与长者服务",
  "One of ten photographed selections, not the complete pamphlet. National Chinese Welfare Council of Detroit funding credited on cover; Burton Historical Collection, DPL. Exact publication and individual photograph dates not established. Page documents clinic, medication, consultation and senior meals; exact room address is not given.": "这十份拍摄选页中的一页，不是完整宣传册。封面注明由底特律 National Chinese Welfare Council 资助；藏于底特律公共图书馆 Burton 历史馆藏。确切出版日期与各张照片的拍摄日期尚未确定。页面记录诊所、药物、咨询与长者供餐；未给出具体房间地址。",
  "Detroit Chinese — Moon Festival": "《Detroit Chinese》选页：中秋节",
  "Detroit Chinese — Wah Gai Club": "《Detroit Chinese》选页：Wah Gai Club",
  "King Ying Lo restaurant postcard": "King Ying Lo 餐馆明信片",
  "DPL search-index lead. Full catalog and asset blocked by verification in this environment. King Ying Lo variants may repeat the same view; do not count as independent building evidence.": "来自底特律公共图书馆搜索索引的线索。完整图录与图像尚未取得。King Ying Lo 的不同版本可能重复同一视角，不能当作相互独立的建筑证据。",
  "Kinsel Drug Co. — Chinese restaurant subject lead": "Kinsel Drug Co.：华人餐馆主题线索",
  "The facade carries Merchants Association signage, linking association rooms and commercial storefronts within the same building.": "立面带有商会招牌，将社团空间与商业店面联系到同一栋建筑之中。",
  "Bunting, parked cars and pedestrians are visible in the 1950-cataloged photograph. It does not establish people’s identities or the reason for that particular gathering.": "目录标注为 1950 年的照片可见彩饰、停放的汽车与行人；不能据此确定人物身份或此次聚集的原因。",
  "A separate 1939 archive record identifies the Merchants Association building at 1341 Third Street and shows convention decorations. Its date must not be transferred to the 1950 photograph.": "另一份 1939 年档案指出商会建筑位于第三街 1341 号，并展示会议装饰。不能将该日期移用到 1950 年的照片上。",
  "The 1963-cataloged Cass Avenue photograph shows a two-storey Merchants Association building with a Shanghai Chop Suey sign.": "目录标注为 1963 年的 Cass 大道照片显示一栋两层商会建筑，带有 Shanghai Chop Suey 招牌。",
  "The photograph places a market frontage between the Shanghai building and Chung’s farther along the street.": "照片显示市场店面位于 Shanghai 餐馆建筑与街道更远处的 Chung’s 之间。",
  "The City of Detroit historical account dates the start of the move to Cass Avenue and Peterboro to 1963 and the association building’s opening to May 12, 1963.": "底特律市历史叙述将迁往 Cass 大道与 Peterboro 的起始时间定为 1963 年，将商会建筑开幕定为 1963 年 5 月 12 日。",
  "The city account gives 3143 Cass for the association building and 3177 Cass for Chung’s. A 1963 newspaper item gives 3153 Cass for the association; this address discrepancy remains unresolved.": "市政府叙述给出商会建筑地址为 Cass 大道 3143 号、Chung’s 为 3177 号；1963 年报纸则将商会地址写为 3153 号。该分歧尚未解决。",
  "The Reuther Library catalogs a celebration at Cass and Peterboro on May 15, 1963. That catalog date and the city’s May 12 opening date are retained separately.": "Reuther 图书馆将 Cass 与 Peterboro 路口庆典的日期标为 1963 年 5 月 15 日。该目录日期与市政府所述 5 月 12 日开幕日期分别保留。",
  "View changed. Confirm the new camera before generating a photograph.": "视角已改变。请重新确认机位后再生成照片。",
  "Filter archive by place": "按地点筛选史料",
  "Filter archive by year": "按年份筛选史料",
  "Filter archive by source type": "按史料类型筛选",
  "Filter archive by date": "按时期筛选史料",
  "Compare the generated image with the camera reference: generation may change geometry or framing. It is not a measured reconstruction.": "请将生成照片与已确认的视角对照：生成过程可能改变几何或构图。这不是实测重建。",
  "The saved task is busy. Checking its status again shortly…": "已保存的任务暂时繁忙，稍后会自动再次检查状态。",
  "Present-day street basemap · historical buildings above": "现代街道底图 · 上方叠加历史建筑",
  "Some street map tiles could not load.": "部分街道底图未能加载。",
  "The street basemap could not load.": "街道底图未能加载。",
  "© OpenStreetMap contributors": "© OpenStreetMap 贡献者",
  "Alignment offset": "朝向微调",
  "Reset alignment": "重置对齐",
  "Model fitted to the selected building footprint. Adjust the alignment offset if its front faces the wrong way, then confirm the camera. Placement and scale remain approximate.": "模型已匹配所选建筑轮廓。若正面朝向不对，请微调朝向，再确认视角。位置和比例仍为近似值。",
  "Choose a year. Double-click a building or the ground to enter street view and explore nearby sources.": "选择年份，双击建筑或地面进入街景，并探索附近的史料。",
  "Choose a point within either study area or its mapped surroundings.": "请在任一研究区域或其周边已绘制地图的范围内选择位置。",
  "No mapped building survey is available at or before this year.": "目前尚无该年或更早的建筑测绘图层。",
  "2010–2024 building inventory ↗": "2010—2024 年建筑清单 ↗",
  "2024 reference only; later building states are unverified.": "仅参考 2024 年资料；此后的建筑状态尚未核实。",
  "2010–2024 inventory: recorded life dates control visibility; earlier forms and heights remain approximate.": "2010—2024 年清单：按所载建成、拆除年份显示建筑；此前的形态和高度仍为近似表达。",
  "Partial map tracings. Empty space may be untraced; it does not establish vacant land. Between surveys, ghost volumes retain the last mapped form.": "地图只描绘了部分建筑；空白可能尚未描绘，不能据此认定为空地。两次测绘之间，以半透明体量保留上次地图的形态。",
  "Building at this point": "所选位置的建筑",
  "Open the building’s map source ↗": "打开这处建筑的地图来源 ↗",
  "Inventory life dates support presence · form from 2024 inventory": "清单中的存续日期支持建筑存在 · 形态参考 2024 年清单",
  "Outside inventory coverage · 2010–2024": "超出清单的时间覆盖范围 · 2010—2024 年",
  "Construction year unknown · omitted before 2024": "建成年份不详 · 2024 年前暂不显示",
  "Before the inventory construction year": "早于清单记录的建成年份",
  "2024 inventory storey count × illustrative 3.2 m per storey; not a historical height measurement.": "依据 2024 年清单层数，按每层约 3.2 米示意挤出；不是历史高度实测。",
  "Illustrative 7 m extrusion; height unknown.": "以 7 米体量示意；实际高度不详。",
  "Illustrative 7 m extrusion; floor counts and building heights not systematically transcribed.": "以 7 米体量示意；尚未系统录入地图中的层数与高度。",
  "SEMCOG records demolition in 2022; the reviewed dated demolition report records 29 July 2023. The timeline uses the latter and retains the inventory value here.": "SEMCOG 清单将拆除记为 2022 年；已核对的拆除报道记为 2023 年 7 月 29 日。时间轴采用后者，并在此保留清单中的冲突记录。",
  "The selected map survey is combined with dated construction, use and demolition records. Historical map coverage is partial. Ghost volumes mark unresolved building states.": "所选地图与注明日期的建造、使用、拆除记录结合。历史地图只覆盖部分建筑；半透明体量表示该年状态尚未确认。",
  "The time control shows the end of each selected year. In 1884, 1921 and 1950, the scene switches to a separately traced map survey; these are partial inventories with different coverage. Between surveys, the last mapped shapes remain as ghost references unless a building life history supports continuity. From 2010 through 2024, SEMCOG construction and demolition fields control the building inventory. Later years retain an explicitly unresolved 2024 reference. A business closure is not treated as demolition. Missing map coverage is not evidence of an empty lot.": "时间轴展示所选年份年末的状态。1884、1921、1950 年切换至分别描绘的地图，各期覆盖范围不同且均不完整。两次测绘之间，若无建筑存续依据，上次地图的形态仅作为半透明参考。2010—2024 年按 SEMCOG 所载建成、拆除年份显示建筑；更晚年份将 2024 年形态标为待核实参考。停业不等于拆除，地图缺漏也不等于空地。",
  "Historical maps: Library of Congress, Sanborn Map Company. The 1884 georeferenced sheets are credited to OldInsuranceMaps.net contributors. The 1950 maps are revised editions, not unchanged 1921 maps.": "历史地图：美国国会图书馆、Sanborn Map Company。1884 年地图的地理配准由 OldInsuranceMaps.net 贡献者完成。1950 年地图为修订版，不能按未修改的 1921 年地图使用。",
  "Historical source underlay": "叠加历史原图",
  "Dated source image beneath its building layer.": "对应年代的原图叠在建筑模型下方。",
  "No registered source image for this layer; current streets remain below.": "此图层尚无配准原图，底层保留现今道路地图。",
  "Selected visible roofs from the 2005 aerial image. Roof edges, ground footprints and heights differ. Empty space may be untraced; it does not establish vacant land.": "从 2005 年航拍中选取的可见屋顶。屋顶投影不同于地面轮廓，高度仍为示意。空白也可能尚未描图，不能证明是空地。",
  "Illustrative 7 m extrusion; story counts and heights are not transcribed from this sheet.": "示意拉伸高度 7 米；尚未逐项录入原图中的层数与高度。",
  "Illustrative 9 m extrusion; a roof outline does not establish building height.": "示意拉伸高度 9 米；屋顶轮廓不能证明建筑高度。",
  "Earlier spatial history · building layer unresolved": "早期空间史 · 建筑图层尚有空缺",
  "Counts describe traced envelopes, not the total buildings present in a year.": "数量表示本次已描出的轮廓，不代表该年全部建筑总数。",
  "Building histories and date conflicts ↗": "建筑沿革与年代冲突 ↗",
  "This is a later reference shape. The building’s presence is supported by dated records; its precise appearance in the selected year is inferred.": "这里使用的是较晚年代的参考轮廓。带日期的记录支持建筑当时存在；所选年份的具体形态仍属推定。",
  "Construction, changes and source records": "建造、改建与史料记录",
  "Source record ↗": "查看原始记录 ↗",
  "Illustrative 7 m extrusion; no verified height or storey count transcribed.": "示意高度为 7 米；尚未核实高度或转录层数。",
  "Depicted station location read from 1950 map. Camera position and bearing unverified.": "据 1950 年地图标记画面中车站的位置；拍摄机位与朝向未核实。",
  "Construction listed as 1905. The modern inventory labels this outline 2952 Second; the 1950 map places it at the Manhattan / 2966–72 Second location.": "建筑档案记为 1905 年建造。现代清单把该轮廓标作 Second 大道 2952 号；1950 年地图显示这里是 Manhattan 公寓，即 2966–72 号。",
  "Construction listed as 1911. The modern inventory labels this outline 2966 Second; the 1950 map labels this middle apartment Altadena / 2952–58 Second.": "建筑档案记为 1911 年建造。现代清单把该轮廓标作 Second 大道 2966 号；1950 年地图将中间这栋标为 Altadena 公寓，即 2952–58 号。",
  "The same designation report gives 1904 in the inventory description and 1905 in the narrative; retain a 1904–1905 interval.": "同一份保护区报告的清单记为 1904 年，叙述部分记为 1905 年；这里保留 1904–1905 年的不确定区间。",
  "Construction listed as 1916; modern inventory says 1949. Local report says three storeys, National Register description says three-and-a-half; this mass uses three.": "建筑档案记为 1916 年，现代清单记为 1949 年。地方报告记三层，国家登记说明记三层半；此体量暂用三层。",
  "Construction listed as 1926; modern inventory says 1925.": "建筑档案记为 1926 年；现代清单记为 1925 年。",
  "Construction listed as 1914; modern inventory says 1912.": "建筑档案记为 1914 年；现代清单记为 1912 年。",
  "Construction listed as 1924.": "建筑档案记为 1924 年建造。",
  "Construction listed as 1908; modern inventory says 1912.": "建筑档案记为 1908 年；现代清单记为 1912 年。",
  "The report dates the building 1920 in its description and discusses the new headquarters in 1921. Retain 1920–1921.": "报告的建筑说明记为 1920 年，叙述新总部时记为 1921 年。这里保留 1920–1921 年的区间。",
  "Construction campaign began in 1920 and was completed in 1926. Its three principal masses have 14, 7 and 10 storeys. The source-date label 1922 does not mean the whole complex was complete then.": "建筑群于 1920 年开始施工，1926 年完工。三个主体分别为 14、7、10 层。档案标签中的 1922 年不代表整个建筑群当年已经完工。",
  "The report gives 1928–1930 in the building description but 1927 for the move in its narrative. Retain 1927–1930 as uncertain. Central pavilion five-and-a-half storeys, flanking wings four.": "报告的建筑说明记为 1928–1930 年，迁入叙述却记为 1927 年。这里保留 1927–1930 年的不确定区间。中央主体五层半，两侧翼楼四层。",
  "Construction listed as 1878. A third floor was added about 1900–1910; the later 3.5-storey reference model is introduced only from 1910.": "建筑记为 1878 年建造，约 1900–1910 年增建第三层。较晚的三层半参考体量仅从 1910 年起展示。",
  "Construction listed as 1936 as a film-exchange building; modern inventory says 1904. Michigan Chronicle use begins in the 1960s, not the construction year.": "档案记为 1936 年建造，最初用作影片发行机构；现代清单记为 1904 年。《Michigan Chronicle》在 1960 年代迁入，这不是建筑的建造年份。",
  "Envelope shown on the 1950 Sanborn source sheet.": "1950 年 Sanborn 原图上可见该建筑轮廓。",
  "A corresponding building outline remains in the 2024 inventory. Continuous survival between dated records is an inference; facade alterations remain unresolved.": "2024 年清单中仍有对应建筑轮廓。两次记录之间持续存在属于推断；立面改动尚未核实。",
  "Third floor added approximately 1900–1910; no earlier three-storey model is asserted.": "约 1900–1910 年增建第三层；此模型不把三层形态前推到更早年份。",
  "Station opened in 1893; rail service ended in 1971. Closure is not demolition.": "车站于 1893 年启用，1971 年停止铁路服务。停止运营不等于拆除。",
  "Headhouse and wing mapped in 1950.": "1950 年地图记录了车站主楼与沿街翼楼。",
  "Museum chronology places demolition three years after the 1971 end of service: 1974.": "博物馆的沿革说明指出：1971 年停止服务，三年后拆除，即 1974 年。",
  "Construction listed as 1905. The modern inventory labels this outline 2952 Second; the 1950 map places it at the Manhattan / 2966–72 Second location. Raw inventory construction year: 1910.": "建筑档案记为 1905 年建造。现代清单把该轮廓标作 Second 大道 2952 号；1950 年地图显示这里是 Manhattan 公寓，即 2966–72 号。 清单原始建造年份：1910。",
  "Construction listed as 1911. The modern inventory labels this outline 2966 Second; the 1950 map labels this middle apartment Altadena / 2952–58 Second. Raw inventory construction year: 1910.": "建筑档案记为 1911 年建造。现代清单把该轮廓标作 Second 大道 2966 号；1950 年地图将中间这栋标为 Altadena 公寓，即 2952–58 号。 清单原始建造年份：1910。",
  "The same designation report gives 1904 in the inventory description and 1905 in the narrative; retain a 1904–1905 interval. Raw inventory construction year: 1918.": "同一份保护区报告的清单记为 1904 年，叙述部分记为 1905 年；这里保留 1904–1905 年的不确定区间。 清单原始建造年份：1918。",
  "Construction listed as 1916; modern inventory says 1949. Local report says three storeys, National Register description says three-and-a-half; this mass uses three. Raw inventory construction year: 1949.": "建筑档案记为 1916 年，现代清单记为 1949 年。地方报告记三层，国家登记说明记三层半；此体量暂用三层。 清单原始建造年份：1949。",
  "Construction listed as 1926; modern inventory says 1925. Raw inventory construction year: 1925.": "建筑档案记为 1926 年；现代清单记为 1925 年。 清单原始建造年份：1925。",
  "Construction listed as 1914; modern inventory says 1912. Raw inventory construction year: 1912.": "建筑档案记为 1914 年；现代清单记为 1912 年。 清单原始建造年份：1912。",
  "Construction listed as 1924. Raw inventory construction year: 1924.": "建筑档案记为 1924 年建造。 清单原始建造年份：1924。",
  "Construction listed as 1908; modern inventory says 1912. Raw inventory construction year: 1912.": "建筑档案记为 1908 年；现代清单记为 1912 年。 清单原始建造年份：1912。",
  "The report dates the building 1920 in its description and discusses the new headquarters in 1921. Retain 1920–1921. Raw inventory construction year: 1921.": "报告的建筑说明记为 1920 年，叙述新总部时记为 1921 年。这里保留 1920–1921 年的区间。 清单原始建造年份：1921。",
  "Construction campaign began in 1920 and was completed in 1926. Its three principal masses have 14, 7 and 10 storeys. The source-date label 1922 does not mean the whole complex was complete then. Raw inventory construction year: 1922.": "建筑群于 1920 年开始施工，1926 年完工。三个主体分别为 14、7、10 层。档案标签中的 1922 年不代表整个建筑群当年已经完工。 清单原始建造年份：1922。",
  "The report gives 1928–1930 in the building description but 1927 for the move in its narrative. Retain 1927–1930 as uncertain. Central pavilion five-and-a-half storeys, flanking wings four. Raw inventory construction year: 1930.": "报告的建筑说明记为 1928–1930 年，迁入叙述却记为 1927 年。这里保留 1927–1930 年的不确定区间。中央主体五层半，两侧翼楼四层。 清单原始建造年份：1930。",
  "Construction listed as 1878. A third floor was added about 1900–1910; the later 3.5-storey reference model is introduced only from 1910. Raw inventory construction year: 1880.": "建筑记为 1878 年建造，约 1900–1910 年增建第三层。较晚的三层半参考体量仅从 1910 年起展示。 清单原始建造年份：1880。",
  "Construction listed as 1936 as a film-exchange building; modern inventory says 1904. Michigan Chronicle use begins in the 1960s, not the construction year. Raw inventory construction year: 1904.": "档案记为 1936 年建造，最初用作影片发行机构；现代清单记为 1904 年。《Michigan Chronicle》在 1960 年代迁入，这不是建筑的建造年份。 清单原始建造年份：1904。",
  "Hand-read simplified envelope from the 1950 Sanborn sheet.": "根据 1950 年 Sanborn 图人工描绘的简化轮廓。",
  "Hand-read simplified envelope from the 1950 Sanborn sheet. Outer outline generalized from 1950 map. Internal division positions are interpretive; 14 / 7 / 10 storeys from designation report. Towers, roof profiles and setbacks not reconstructed.": "根据 1950 年 Sanborn 图人工描绘的简化轮廓。外轮廓据 1950 年图简化，内部三部分的分界位置为解释性估计；14／7／10 层取自保护区报告。尚未复原塔楼、屋顶线和退台。",
  "Hand-read simplified envelope from the 1950 Sanborn sheet. 1950 predecessor; not the later building with inventory construction date 1966.": "根据 1950 年 Sanborn 图人工描绘的简化轮廓。这是 1950 年的前身建筑，与现代清单记为 1966 年建造的后来建筑区分。",
  "Hand-read simplified envelope from the 1950 Sanborn sheet. Map outline simplified. Division between central pavilion and wings is interpretive, guided by designation-report description; exact roof setbacks unresolved.": "根据 1950 年 Sanborn 图人工描绘的简化轮廓。地图轮廓经过简化。中央主体与两侧翼楼的分界据报告描述推定；准确的屋顶退台仍未确认。",
  "Hand-read simplified envelope from the 1950 Sanborn sheet. 1878 construction; third floor added c.1900–1910. This later 3.5-storey form is not projected before 1910.": "根据 1950 年 Sanborn 图人工描绘的简化轮廓。1878 年建造，约 1900–1910 年增建第三层；此后形成的三层半体量不前推到 1910 年以前。",
  "Hand-read simplified envelope from the 1950 Sanborn sheet. 1950 predecessor envelope; not the postwar Park Plaza building.": "根据 1950 年 Sanborn 图人工描绘的简化轮廓。这是 1950 年的前身建筑轮廓，与战后 Park Plaza 建筑区分。",
  "Hand-read simplified envelope from the 1950 Sanborn sheet. Mapped headhouse envelope, generalized; 3-storey body from postcard reading. Clock-tower height is unresolved and not extruded as a measured tower.": "根据 1950 年 Sanborn 图人工描绘的简化轮廓。概括地图上的车站主楼轮廓；根据明信片读取三层主体。钟塔高度尚未核实，未按实测塔高建模。",
  "Hand-read simplified envelope from the 1950 Sanborn sheet. Wing generalized from 1950 outline. Two-storey mass is a visual interpretation from the postcard, not surveyed height.": "根据 1950 年 Sanborn 图人工描绘的简化轮廓。翼楼据 1950 年轮廓简化；两层体量是根据明信片作出的视觉解读，不是实测高度。",
  "Show 2D basemap": "显示二维底图",
  "Show historical roads": "显示历史道路",
  "Map layers": "地图图层",
  "Road changes & sources": "道路变迁与史料",
  "2D basemap hidden": "二维底图已隐藏",
  "Dated source images where available; current streets outside.": "已配准处显示历史原图，范围外为现今道路。",
  "Present-day street basemap; no registered historical image for this year.": "当前为现今道路底图；该年尚无已配准的历史原图。",
  "Road layers use separately traced 1897, 1921, 1950 and 2005 evidence. Between those dates, translucent roads retain the last surveyed form; they do not establish uninterrupted survival. Missing traces do not establish that a road was absent. Road width is approximate; thin 3D bands make alignments visible without claiming surveyed pavement, bridge or cutting heights.": "道路层分别提取自 1897、1921、1950 和 2005 年史料。期间的半透明道路沿用最近一次史料形态，不能证明一直存在；未提取的区域也不能证明没有道路。道路宽度为近似值，三维薄体量用于显示走向，不代表实测的路面、桥梁或下穿高程。",
  "Snap to archive years": "吸附史料年份",
  "Dots mark dated archive records. Click a dot to jump; type a year for exact selection.": "圆点代表有日期的史料。点击圆点跳转；输入年份可精确选择。",
  "Archive years": "史料年份",
  "Chinatown-associated building": "与唐人街有史料关联的建筑",
  "Surrounding building": "周边建筑",
  "Click map · WASD to move · drag to orbit · scroll to zoom": "点击地图 · WASD 移动 · 拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放",
  "Click map · WASD to move · drag to adjust view": "点击地图 · WASD 移动 · 拖动调整视角",
  "Chinatown Sign Kiosk": "唐人街标志亭",
  "Possible mapped building · outline needs verification": "可能存在的地图建筑 · 轮廓尚待核实",
  "Presence documented · later outline and historical form are conjectural": "有建筑存在的记录 · 后期轮廓与历史形态为推测",
  "Inventory storeys × illustrative 3.2 m; past height and alterations unresolved.": "建筑清单层数 × 示意层高 3.2 米；历史高度与改建尚未核实。",
  "Illustrative 7 m; height unknown.": "暂以 7 米示意；高度不详。",
  "Illustrative 7 m candidate volume; height not transcribed.": "候选体量暂以 7 米示意；尚未逐栋读取高度。",
  "Zoom to inspect smaller buildings.": "放大查看较小建筑。",
  "Automatic snap to archive years.": "自动吸附到有史料的年份。",
  "Map: 1880–2026. Earlier material remains in the archive.": "地图显示 1880–2026 年。更早的资料仍保留在史料库中。",
  "The map covers 1900–2026. Browse the archive for earlier material.": "地图显示 1880–2026 年。请前往史料库查阅更早的资料。",
  "Dark blue: long-lived alignment · Light blue: changed or unresolved · Zoom in for road names": "深蓝：走向延续至今 · 淡蓝：已变化或待考证 · 放大后显示路名",
  "Dark blue: long-lived alignment · Light blue: changed or unresolved · Hollow: legal change trace · Zoom in for road names": "深蓝：有依据的持续走向 · 淡蓝：已改变或未确认 · 空心：法律变更轮廓 · 放大显示路名",
  "Major milestones": "主要历史节点",
  "Layers": "图层",
  "Present-day map": "现今地图",
  "Historical map": "历史地图",
  "Historical roads": "历史道路",
  "Map legend": "地图图例",
  "Chinatown": "唐人街",
  "Other buildings": "其他建筑",
  "Inferred outline": "推测轮廓",
  "Historical road": "历史道路",
  "Surviving route": "延续至今的道路",
  "Map sources": "地图依据",
  "Road sources": "道路依据",
  "Interactive 3D map. Double-click a building or ground in either study area and its surroundings to enter street view.": "交互式三维地图。双击研究区域及周边的建筑或地面，进入街景模式。",
  "Building ahead · use WASD to go around.": "前方有建筑 · 请用 WASD 绕行。",
  "WASD move · drag to look · scroll to zoom · double-click a location to enter street view": "WASD 移动 · 拖动调整视角 · 滚轮缩放 · 双击地图上的位置进入街景",
  "No historical map for this year": "该年暂无历史底图",
  "Photos: selected year ±5 years": "照片：所选年份前后 5 年",
  "No dated photographs nearby for this period. Try another year or browse the archive.": "附近没有符合这一时期的照片。可切换年份或浏览史料库。",
  "No photograph is dated to this exact year. Nearby dates are labelled on each image.": "暂无恰好摄于这一年的照片。各张照片均标注了史料年代。",
  "Dots mark major milestones. Every year remains selectable. Earlier records remain in the archive.": "圆点表示主要历史节点；所有年份仍可选择。更早的记录保留在史料库中。",
  "Buildings follow the selected map and recorded changes. White and pink volumes remain opaque between surveys; colour does not establish uninterrupted survival. Translucent inventory outlines are hypotheses. Select a building to inspect its evidence.": "建筑按所选地图与沿革记录显示。两次测绘之间保持白色或粉红色实体，颜色不代表已确认持续存在。半透明清单轮廓属于推测。点击建筑可核查依据。",
  "Photographs appear within five years of the selected date or a stated short date range. Undated images remain in the archive.": "照片按所选年份前后五年或明确的短年代区间匹配。无日期照片保留在史料库。",
  "Dark blue marks a route documented through the present; light blue includes earlier or unresolved routes. Road records can describe legal changes without establishing physical opening or removal dates.": "深蓝表示有据可查、延续至今的走向；淡蓝表示其他历史道路。法律变更日期不直接等同于道路实际通车或拆除日期。",
  "Move outside the building before confirming this view.": "请先移至建筑外部，再确认视角。",
  "The selected map survey is combined with dated construction, use and demolition records. Historical map coverage is partial. Source dates and uncertainty remain in each building record.": "地图结合建筑建造、使用和拆除记录显示。具体史料日期与不确定性见各栋建筑的记录。",
  "Historical milestones": "历史事件",
  "Third Avenue / downtown": "第三大道 / 市中心",
  "Railways": "铁路",
  "Water & border": "水域与国界",
  "Chinatown kiosk": "唐人街标志亭",
  "Chinatown association": "唐人街关联",
  "Building life over 50 years": "总存续超过 50 年",
  "Uncertain presence · 25% transparent": "存续未确认 · 25% 透明",
  "Demolished · five-year trace": "已拆除 · 五年轮廓",
  "Historical / inferred road": "历史／推测道路",
  "Surviving alignment": "延续至今的走向",
  "Freeway / elevated road": "高速公路／高架路",
  "Railway / station": "铁路／车站",
  "Water · present-day reference": "水域 · 现今参考",
  "Shoreline · present-day reference": "岸线 · 现今参考",
  "US–Canada border": "美国—加拿大国界",
  "Land / scene ground": "陆地／场景地面",
  "Archive photograph": "档案照片",
  "Selection": "所选位置",
  "Pink label: lighter to darker = less to more community activity": "粉色标签：越深表示社区活动越活跃",
  "Source-map colors retain their original key": "原地图色彩参见原图图例",
  "Detroit River": "底特律河",
  "Fort Street Union Depot": "Fort Street 联合车站",
  "Michigan Central Station": "密歇根中央车站",
  "Cass / Peterboro": "Cass / Peterboro",
  "No registered historical image for this year": "该年暂无已配准历史地图",
  "Historical images share the building coordinate system and retain their source year. Between surveys, the last mapped form may remain as a reference; this does not prove that every building was unchanged. Uncertain inventory backcasts are 25% transparent. Yellow identifies a documented total building life over 50 years; dated Chinatown associations take pink priority.": "历史原图与建筑采用同一坐标系统，并保留原图年份。两次测绘之间可能沿用上次形态作为参考，不能证明所有建筑均未改变。现代清册推测且存续未确认的体量为 25% 透明。黄色代表有记录支持总存续超过 50 年；该年有唐人街关联时优先显示粉色。",
  "Community-label intensity is a qualitative reading of cited activity, not population data. Labels move with the 1963 relocation; fewer businesses do not mean the community disappeared. The kiosk is a separate layer, with an approximate 1960s installation date.": "社区标签深浅是根据所引资料作出的定性解读，不是人口数据。标签随 1963 年搬迁移动；商业减少不等于社区消失。标志亭独立控制，安装年代约为 1960 年代。",
  "Railway service, construction and removal dates are distinct. Historical tracings are combined with municipal and regional reference alignments. Elevated rail and the Ford–Lodge crossing use illustrative heights. Water, shorelines and the international border are present-day geographic references.": "铁路运营、建设及拆除日期分别记录。历史描图结合市政府和区域机构的参考走向；高架铁路及 Ford–Lodge 立交采用示意高度。水域、岸线及国界为现今地理参考。",
  "People Mover history ↗": "People Mover 沿革 ↗",
  "Rail alignment source ↗": "铁路走向来源 ↗",
  "Water source ↗": "水域来源 ↗",
  "Boundary reference ↗": "国界参考 ↗",
  "Independent building history supports presence · later reference form": "独立建筑沿革支持当时存在 · 较晚的参考形态",
  "Questions use the point selected on the map.": "问题对应地图中选中的位置。",
  "Your question": "你的问题",
  "Reading sources…": "正在阅读史料…",
  "Language changed. Submit your question again for an answer in this language.": "语言已切换。请重新提交问题，以当前语言获取回答。",
  "Your selection or question changed. Submit again to read the current selection.": "所选位置或问题已改变。请重新提交，解读当前选择。",
  "Choose one exact year for this question; a decade cannot select one map view.": "请指定一个确切年份；年代范围无法对应一个地图视图。",
  "Regional heat map": "区域热力图",
 "Address or building name":"地址或建筑名", "Destination year":"目标年份", "Go":"前往", "Stop":"停止",
  "Regional population & activity": "区域人口与活动",
  "Historical coverage is incomplete. Translucent source traces need boundary and height verification.": "历史模型仍有缺口；半透明补绘轮廓的边界和高度尚待核实。",
  "Source-image trace · boundaries / height unverified": "底图补绘 · 边界及高度待核实",
  "Historical coverage is partial. Gray footprints are provisional.": "历史覆盖不完整；灰色轮廓为暂定模型。",
  "Provisional historical mass": "暂定历史体量",
  "Uncertain presence · see building record": "存续未确认 · 详见建筑记录",
  "Buildings follow the selected map and recorded changes. White and pink volumes remain opaque between surveys; colour does not establish uninterrupted survival. Inventory reference forms may be conjectural. Select a building to inspect its evidence.": "建筑按所选地图与沿革记录显示。两次测绘之间保持白色或粉红色实体，颜色不代表已确认持续存在。清单参考形态可能属于推测。点击建筑可核查依据。",
  "Historical images share the building coordinate system and retain their source year. Between surveys, the last mapped form may remain as a reference; this does not prove that every building was unchanged. Inventory backcasts retain their uncertainty in the building record. Yellow identifies a documented total building life over 50 years; dated Chinatown associations take pink priority.": "历史原图与建筑采用同一坐标系统，并保留原图年份。两次测绘之间可能沿用上次形态作为参考，不能证明所有建筑均未改变。现代清册推测的存续不确定性保留在建筑记录中。黄色代表有记录支持总存续超过 50 年；该年有唐人街关联时优先显示粉色。",
  "Railway service, construction and removal dates are distinct. Historical tracings are combined with municipal and regional reference alignments. Elevated rail and the Ford–Lodge crossing use illustrative heights.": "铁路运营、建设及拆除日期分别记录。历史描图结合市政府和区域机构的参考走向；高架铁路及 Ford–Lodge 立交采用示意高度。",
  "Minority communities’ memories of a city in continual renewal.": "城市持续更新中，少数族裔对城市的记忆。",
  "After Chinatown": "唐人街之后",
  "Detroit / Research prototype": "底特律 / 研究原型",
  "Preserving everyday memories as the city changes. Select a place and year to explore.": "在城市变迁中保存日常生活的记忆。选择地点与年份，进入街区。",
  "About the project": "关于项目",
  "Remembering everyday life in a changing city.": "在城市变迁中，保存日常生活的记忆。",
  "Explore photographs, maps, films and recollections of Chinese American life in Detroit. Check each record for its date and source.": "浏览底特律华裔生活的照片、地图、影片与回忆。年代与来源见各条史料。",
  "Explore each source’s date, viewpoint and connection to this place.": "查看每条史料的年代、视角及其与这个地点的联系。",
  "Generated scenes are interpretations, not historical photographs. Sources and uncertain details remain visible.": "生成场景属于演绎，并非历史照片；来源与未确认的细节会保留说明。",
  "Reconstructing Chinese American Urban Memory in Detroit": "城市更新中的华裔生活记忆与数字重建",
  "After Chinatown | Detroit": "唐人街之后 | 底特律",
  "Archive | After Chinatown": "史料库 | 唐人街之后",
  "About": "关于项目",
  "Urban change can erase familiar places while memories live on. After Chinatown preserves the traces of Chinese American life in Detroit: its gathering places, family stories and everyday experiences.": "城市更新改变熟悉的场所，生活的记忆仍在延续。唐人街之后关注底特律华裔的聚集空间、家族故事与日常经验，保存他们留在城市中的生活印记。",
  "Many of these experiences remain scattered or absent from public records. Keeping them accessible gives future generations a connection to the city their families knew.": "许多生活经验散落在个人记忆中，尚未进入公共记录。保存这些记忆，让后代能够认识家人曾经生活过的城市。",
  "Preserving Chinese American urban memory as Detroit changes.": "在底特律持续的城市更新中，保存华裔的城市生活记忆。",
  "Map notes & sources": "地图说明与来源",
  "Third · core buildings": "第三街 · 核心建筑",
  "Cass · core buildings": "Cass · 核心建筑",
  "Rendering effects": "渲染效果",
  "Road names": "路名",
  "Building tags": "建筑标签",
  "Chinatown tags": "唐人街标签",
  "Controls map labels; text printed in map images remains.": "控制地图标签；底图与历史图像中印有的文字保留。",
  "View image": "查看图片",
  "Filter photographs by year or date range. Include undated images to explore sources without a confirmed date.": "按年份或时间段筛选照片；勾选“包含年代不详”，可查看拍摄日期尚未确认的影像。"
},textState=new WeakMap(),attributeState=new WeakMap();let lang='en',scheduled=false;
 try{lang=(window.ATLAS_PAGE||window.ARCHIVE_PAGE)?.language||'en';}catch(_){}if(lang!=='zh')lang='en';
 const fragments=[['Third Avenue / downtown','第三大道 / 市中心'],['Original Chinatown','原唐人街'],['Relocated Chinatown','迁址唐人街'],['Third Avenue','第三大道'],['Third Street','第三街'],['Source date: ','史料日期：'],['Source date overlaps ','史料年代涵盖 '],['Different source date · ','其他年代的史料 · '],['~','约 '],[' m to marker',' 米至近似标记'],['position uncertainty ±','位置不确定度 ±'],[' · original model reference',' · 建模的原始照片'],['Depicted building · approximate historic address','画面中的建筑 · 近似历史地址'],['Depicted building · City StoryMap marker','画面中的建筑 · 市政府 StoryMap 标记'],['Street-level attribution · camera not located','所属街道已知 · 拍摄机位未定位'],['Historical references · original + ','历史照片参考 · 原图 + '],[' nearby photographs',' 张附近照片'],['Cached source interpretation','已缓存的史料解读'],['AI-assisted source interpretation','AI 辅助史料解读'],['Building the detailed model · ','正在生成精细模型 · '],['Mapped in ','见于地图：'],['Use documented; footprint carried from ','有用途记录；参考体量来自 '],['Demolished · ','已拆除 · '],['3143 Cass · Chinese Merchants Association','Cass 大道 3143 号 · 中华商会'],['Chung’s · Cass / Peterboro','Chung’s 餐厅 · Cass / Peterboro'],['Building state unverified for ','该年建筑状态未确认：'],[' reference only',' 年参考体量'],[' m around the selected point',' 米范围，以所选位置为中心'],['Build ','版本 '],['Select photograph: ','选择照片：'],['Unknown','不详'],[' m radius',' 米半径'],['approximately ','约 '],[' m from selected point',' 米距所选位置'],['location uncertainty ','位置不确定度 '],['Original model reference','建模的原始照片'],['date issued; capture date unconfirmed','发行日期；拍摄日期未确认']];
 function translate(value){
  if(value.endsWith(' · Arrived'))return value.slice(0,-10)+' · 已到达';const trimmed=value.trim();if(!trimmed)return value;if(dictionary[trimmed])return value.replace(trimmed,dictionary[trimmed]);let m;
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^(\d+) photos · (\d+) m · ±5 years$/)))return `${m[2]} 米内 · ${m[1]} 张照片 · 前后 5 年`;
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^Historical map · (.+)$/)))return `历史地图 · ${m[1]}`;
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^(\d+) map evidence ↗$/)))return `${m[1]} 年地图依据 ↗`;
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^Inventory construction year: (.+) · demolition year: (.+)$/)))return `清单所载建成年份：${m[1]==='Unknown'?'不详':m[1]} · 拆除年份：${m[2]==='Not recorded'?'未记录':m[2]}`;
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^Select photograph: (.+)$/))&&dictionary[m[1]])return '选择照片：'+dictionary[m[1]];
  for(const r of (window.CURATED_ARCHIVE?.records||[])){if(dictionary[r.title]&&value.includes(r.title+' · ')){value=value.replace(r.title,dictionary[r.title]);break;}}
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^(\d+) dated observations · (\d+) documented continuity · (\d+) removed · (\d+) unresolved$/)))return `${m[1]} 处有当年记录 · ${m[2]} 处有存续依据 · ${m[3]} 处已拆除 · ${m[4]} 处状态未确认`;
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^(\d+) photographs within (\d+) m · approximate locations$/)))return `${m[2]} 米内有 ${m[1]} 张照片 · 位置为近似值`;
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^(\d+) photos · (\d+) m$/)))return `${m[2]} 米内 · ${m[1]} 张照片`;
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^◉ (\d+) photos?$/)))return `◉ ${m[1]} 张照片`;
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^(\d+) located photographs · (\d+) awaiting location/)))return `${m[1]} 张照片已关联位置 · ${m[2]} 张待定位`;
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^(\d+) \/ (\d+) model requests and (\d+) \/ (\d+) photo requests remain today, shared by all visitors\. Resets at 00:00 UTC\.$/)))return `今日模型额度剩余 ${m[1]}/${m[2]} 次，照片额度剩余 ${m[3]}/${m[4]} 次，由所有访客共用；UTC 00:00 重置。`;
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^(\d+) matching records? · (\d+) catalog records$/)))return `${m[2]} 条目录记录中，${m[1]} 条符合筛选条件`;
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^No located photograph in this radius has a source date matching (\d+). Other dates remain visible as context; they do not establish the appearance in \d+\.$/)))return `这个半径内没有史料日期与 ${m[1]} 年匹配的已定位照片。其他年代的照片可提供背景，但不能证明该年的景象。`;
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^Open source-date matches for this point and (\d+) m radius; the archive page also lets you broaden the dates\.$/)))return `打开所选位置 ${m[1]} 米内、符合史料年代的记录；也可在史料页扩大年代范围。`;
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^Target year: (\d+). The confirmed 3D view was supplied as a composition reference, with archival photographs for visible detail\.$/)))return `目标年份：${m[1]}。已确认的三维视角作为构图参考，历史照片作为可见细节依据。`;
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^Timeline: (\d+) · (\d+) documented removals · (\d+) unresolved building states\.$/)))return `时间轴：${m[1]} 年 · ${m[2]} 处有拆除记录 · ${m[3]} 处建筑状态未确认。`;
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^Place reference (\d+) ↗$/)))return `地点参考 ${m[1]} ↗`;
 if((m=trimmed.match(/^Possible presence · inventory reports construction in (\d+); later outline is conjectural$/)))return `可能存在 · 清单记载建于 ${m[1]} 年；较晚的轮廓仅作推测`;
 if((m=trimmed.match(/^(\d+) landmark volumes use a dated reference form; presence follows individual life dates, while intervening alterations remain unresolved\.$/)))return ` ${m[1]} 个地标采用有年代的参考形态；存续由逐栋沿革控制，期间改建尚未核实。`;
 if((m=trimmed.match(/^Boundary reference (\d+) ↗$/)))return `界限参考 ${m[1]} ↗`;
  if(trimmed.startsWith('The published archive has no source with a cataloged location matching '))return '已发布史料中没有同时符合所选地点与年份的记录。年代或位置未明确的资料仍可在完整史料库中查阅。';
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^(\d+) aerial evidence ↗$/)))return `${m[1]} 年航拍依据 ↗`;
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^Historical underlay: (.+) · current streets outside$/)))return `历史原图：${m[1]} 年 · 范围外为现今道路`;
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^(\d+) landmark volumes use a 1950 reference form; presence follows individual life dates, while intervening alterations remain unresolved\.$/)))return ` ${m[1]} 个地标体量采用 1950 年参考形态；是否存在由逐栋年代记录控制，期间的改建仍未确认。`;
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^Life dates support presence · (\d+) reference form; alterations unresolved$/)))return `沿革记录支持当时存在 · 采用 ${m[1]} 年参考形态；改建尚未核实`;
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^Presence bracketed by opening and demolition · (\d+) reference form$/)))return `启用与拆除日期支持期间存在 · 采用 ${m[1]} 年参考形态`;
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^([\d.]+) storeys × illustrative 3.2 m; storey count from designation report, meters are not surveyed\.$/)))return `保护区报告记载 ${m[1]} 层，每层暂按 3.2 米示意；不是实测高度。`;
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^([\d.]+) storeys read from source image × illustrative 3.2 m; not surveyed\.$/)))return `从史料图像读取 ${m[1]} 层，每层暂按 3.2 米示意；不是实测高度。`;
  if((m=trimmed.match(/^Presence observed in (\d+) · (\d+) reference shape$/)))return `${m[1]} 年有存续记录 · ${m[2]} 年参考形态`;
 let out=value.replace(' / surrounding city',' / 周边城市');for(const [en,zh]of fragments)out=out.replaceAll(en,zh);return out;
 }
 function localizeText(node){const p=node.parentElement;if(!p||p.closest('script,style,textarea,[data-no-translate],#language-switch'))return;let item=textState.get(node);if(!item||node.nodeValue!==item.last)item={original:node.nodeValue,last:node.nodeValue};const next=lang==='zh'?translate(item.original):item.original;if(node.nodeValue!==next)node.nodeValue=next;item.last=next;textState.set(node,item);}
 function localizeAttr(el,name){if(!el.hasAttribute(name)||el.closest('[data-no-translate]')||el.id==='language-switch')return;let all=attributeState.get(el)||{},item=all[name],value=el.getAttribute(name);if(!item||value!==item.last)item={original:value,last:value};const next=lang==='zh'?translate(item.original):item.original;if(value!==next)el.setAttribute(name,next);item.last=next;all[name]=item;attributeState.set(el,all);}
 function apply(){scheduled=false;observer.disconnect();const title=document.querySelector('title');if(title?.firstChild)localizeText(title.firstChild);const walker=document.createTreeWalker(document.body,NodeFilter.SHOW_TEXT);while(walker.nextNode())localizeText(walker.currentNode);document.querySelectorAll('[placeholder],[aria-label],[title]').forEach(el=>{for(const a of ['placeholder','aria-label','title'])localizeAttr(el,a);});document.documentElement.lang=lang==='zh'?'zh-Hans':'en';const b=document.getElementById('language-switch');if(b){b.textContent=lang==='en'?'中文':'English';b.setAttribute('aria-label',lang==='en'?'Switch to Chinese':'Switch to English');}
  const app=(window.ATLAS_PAGE||window.ARCHIVE_PAGE)?.appUrl;if(app)document.querySelectorAll('a[href]').forEach(a=>{if(a.href.startsWith(app)){const u=new URL(a.href);u.searchParams.set('lang',lang);a.href=u.href;}});
  observer.observe(document.body,{subtree:true,childList:true,characterData:true,attributes:true,attributeFilter:['placeholder','aria-label','title','href']});
 }
 const observer=new MutationObserver(records=>{if(records.every(r=>(r.target.nodeType===1?r.target:r.target.parentElement)?.closest('#scene,#atlas-basemap,#atlas-labels,#mobile-atlas-shell')))return;if(!scheduled){scheduled=true;requestAnimationFrame(apply);}});
 function set(next){lang=next==='zh'?'zh':'en';try{localStorage.setItem('chinatown-language',lang);}catch(_){}apply();window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('atlas-language-changed',{detail:{language:lang}}));}
 const b=document.getElementById('language-switch');if(b)b.onclick=()=>set(lang==='en'?'zh':'en');apply();return {language:()=>lang,set,translate:value=>lang==='zh'?translate(value):value};
})();
